<!-- ══════════════════ SECTION 5: MOMENTUM & LIQUIDITY ══════════════════ -->
<div class="section" id="s5">
  <div class="section-header">
    <span class="section-num">05</span>
    <span class="section-title">Momentum Dynamics &amp; Liquidity Behavior</span>
  </div>

  <div class="callout">
    MA50/MA200 crossovers identify sustained trend regimes. The 20-day Rate of Change (ROC) measures short-term momentum. Volume data is reliable post-2003; early-period zeros are flagged. Volume has grown significantly over the dataset, reflecting gold's rising institutional adoption.
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="card-title">Gold Price with MA-50 &amp; MA-200 Moving Averages</div>
    <div class="chart-wrap" style="height:300px">
      <canvas id="maChart"></canvas>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="two-col">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title">20-Day Rate of Change (ROC) — Momentum Signal</div>
      <div class="chart-wrap" style="height:220px">
        <canvas id="rocChart"></canvas>
      </div>
